{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"SNG","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"雅歌","commonName":"雅歌","title":"雅歌","order":22,"numberOfChapters":8,"sha256":"820389c30d8a5130337eaf73a3bc30375c6a468dc71a42108db52533b55d6738","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/SNG/1.json","lastChapterNumber":8,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/SNG/8.json","totalNumberOfVerses":117},"chapter":{"number":6,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"絕色佳人啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的良人去了何處？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的良人轉往何方？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我們好幫你尋找他。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"text":"我的良人下到自己的園中，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在香草花圃中牧放他的羊群，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"採集百合花。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我屬於我的良人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的良人也屬於我。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他在百合花間牧放羊群。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"text":"我的愛人啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你像得撒一樣秀麗，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"像耶路撒冷一樣佳美，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"像旌旗飄揚的軍隊一樣威嚴。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求你把視線移開吧，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為你的眼波使我迷亂。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的秀髮像從基列山坡下來的山羊群。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的牙齒如同一群從水裡洗淨上來的母羊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"成雙成對，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"一顆也沒有脫落。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你面紗後面的雙頰如兩瓣石榴。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"雖有六十個王后，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"八十個妃嬪和無數的宮女，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但我完美無瑕的小鴿子獨一無二，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她是她母親的獨女和最愛。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"眾女子看見她都誇她有福，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"王后和妃嬪見了也連連稱讚她，說：","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「這位燦爛似晨光，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"皎潔如月亮，明媚如太陽，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"亮麗如佈滿天際之星辰","poem":1},{"noteId":3},{"text":"的是誰呢？」","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"text":"我下到核桃園中，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要看看谷中嫩綠的花木，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看看葡萄樹是否已發芽，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"石榴樹是否正在開花。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不知不覺，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的心把我帶到我尊長的車上。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"text":"回來吧，回來吧，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"書拉密的少女！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"回來吧，回來吧，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"好讓我們再看看你！","poem":1},"男子：",{"text":"你們為何目不轉睛地看著書拉密的少女，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"好像觀看瑪哈念的舞蹈呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":3,"caller":"+","text":"「佈滿天際之星辰」希伯來文是「威嚴如旌旗飄揚的軍隊」，希伯來人常把星星比作天上的軍隊。","reference":{"chapter":6,"verse":10}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/SNG/6.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/SNG/7.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/SNG/5.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":13}